<title>USA: Noble Drilling Corp Q3 shr jumps.</title>
<headline>Noble Drilling Corp Q3 shr jumps.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.19   profit	 $0.01</p>
<p> Net profit		25,221   profit	 2,315</p>
<p> Revs		     158,072		   84,652</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 123,755		   95,487</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.45     loss	 $0.12</p>
<p> Net profit		52,200     loss	 2,684</p>
<p> Revs		     372,515		  243,733</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 104,968		   88,024</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 results include a charge of $7.6 million related to the adoption of an accounting procedure, known as SFAS No. 121, offset by a gain of $7.527 million related to the sale of two posted barge rigs.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
